{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46889","headline":"荆门暮冬与节公话别 · 齐己","name":"荆门暮冬与节公话别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漳河湘岸柳关头，离别相逢四十秋。\n我忆黄梅梦南国，君怀明主去东周。\n几程霜雪经残腊，何处封疆过旧游。\n好及春风承帝泽，莫忘衰朽卧林丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}